    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discover the Forgotten Lands</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/19f494d36d11e98aae83036a6d986f62.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Imagine a place where everything that is lost and forgotten goes; old toys, letters, single socks. The Forgotten Lands is a magical world inhabited by forgotlings; creatures composed of mislaid objects longing to be remembered again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forgotlings is a cinematic story-driven action-adventure</strong> where you'll play as Fig, a once-forgotten posing doll now captain of the sentient lightship Volare. As shadows stir and ancient divisions crack the land, you must soar across windswept skies and forgotten cities, uniting warring tribes before everything unravels. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Embark on a Hand-Animated Journey:</strong> Experience thousands of meticulously hand-crafted frame-by-frame animations &amp; stunning landscapes that bring the Forgotten Lands to life, making every moment feel like you\u2019re playing through an animated movie. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/5f16d8ea23ca1eb82482177c706c9b03.avif?t=1754894026\" data-has-big /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Swordplay and Diplomacy:</strong> Persuade forgotlings to join your cause, defend settlements from bandits, and settle disputes through INA, a cherished board game that fosters unity in a fractured world.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Combat:</strong> Charge head-on with hack-and-slash action or strike from the shadows with devastating sneak attacks. Unlock powerful upgrades as you forge bonds with forgotlings across the land. Includes a Story Mode for players who want to focus on the narrative. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/b795efda717101e1347bdf0c1f6b1679.poster.avif?t=1754894026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/b795efda717101e1347bdf0c1f6b1679.webm?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/b795efda717101e1347bdf0c1f6b1679.mp4?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore A Wholly-Original World of Wonder:</strong> Sail across the Forgotten Lands aboard the living ship Volare, and win the trust &amp; respect of the five forgotling tribes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/a7c4c6b2d12c2ec9aeffa53ede9d6649.poster.avif?t=1754894026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/a7c4c6b2d12c2ec9aeffa53ede9d6649.webm?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/a7c4c6b2d12c2ec9aeffa53ede9d6649.mp4?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shape Your Story Through Choices:</strong> Your decisions shape Fig\u2019s journey and relationships, influencing the fate of the Forgotten Lands. Use a unique dialogue wheel to navigate tense encounters \u2014 or ease the tension with a clever game of INA, a beloved board game inspired by Chess and Go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/4c58ab2921b9f0aeaf5115aa994e818b.poster.avif?t=1754894026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/4c58ab2921b9f0aeaf5115aa994e818b.webm?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/4c58ab2921b9f0aeaf5115aa994e818b.mp4?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Game of INA:</strong> Navigate tense encounters with wit \u2014 or ease the tension with a clever round of INA, a strategic board game inspired by Chess and Go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immerse Yourself in a Haunting Soundscape:</strong> With a full voice cast and an evocative score featuring the renowned choir ensemble Theatre of Voices, the game's captivating audio design accentuates the emotional highs and lows of your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/0cc99b1dabae959054b990ac1d6a3c86.poster.avif?t=1754894026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/0cc99b1dabae959054b990ac1d6a3c86.webm?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0d Expanded Lore and World-Building</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forgotten Lands:</strong> A magical realm where lost objects\u2014forgotlings\u2014gain consciousness, some with faint memories of their past lives, now seeking meaning and belonging. Bring hope &amp; redemption to a divided world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/1f44791042c41b482f31edcbaf85ebaf.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fig:</strong> Play as Fig, a gifted posing doll adept at learning the ways of the realm, who is caught between the old ways of forgotlings and the rise of a new era.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silvia:</strong> A rebellious member of the Servus tribe, Silvia is an idealistic headstrong activist adamantly opposed to the new spawn trade and believes in fighting for a fairer and more just world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Greyhead:</strong> A feared outsider and ruthless new spawn trader, Greyhead possesses an unusually sharp wit. A realist who opposes &quot;superstitious&quot; tribal beliefs in Man as a benevolent creator of forgotlings worth worshipping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Delilah:</strong>\u00a0An enigma with many connections loyal only to herself and her shifting agendas. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udea9 The Forgotling Tribes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the 5 forgotling tribes that inhabit the Forgotten Lands.\u00a0From the knowledge-seeking Videra to the industrious Aufero, each tribe offers unique perspectives and challenges, enriching your journey through their distinct philosophies and histories.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/5e96061072409dbebbe42ac65367dbe5.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Videra:</strong> Dedicated scholars and keepers of knowledge, residing in Bygone Park. They believe understanding the past is key to shaping the future, and seek to uncover all knowledge of the heavens and the earth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/6f5344e9ebbd2af3d751813c747452e3.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Aufero:</strong> Innovators and engineers from Watchtown, dedicated to progress and technological advancement, often at the cost of tradition. They shape their surroundings and society, forging a future through progress and innovation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/5b33612c2c8fdbc53949b1cef97d8199.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Servus:</strong> The Servus live to serve, finding purpose in protecting and uplifting others. They live in Shelter Island, valuing compassion, and are often seen as the heart of empathy in the realm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/b7fc4d5d7659e008843ddb2de0bbda99.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sonavi:</strong> Adventurous explorers from the Falls, driven to map and connect every corner of the Forgotten Lands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/f36c3318b26e6c8b9c86dc83e6ffd715.avif?t=1754894026\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Karus:</strong> Mysterious and spiritual inhabitants of the Mangroves. The Karus seek enlightenment beyond the material realm, aiming to merge with the anima stream\u2014the life force of the Forgotten Lands.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u26f5\ufe0f Other inhabitants of the Forgotten Lands</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bandits and Outliers:</strong> Forgotlings who reject rigidity of tribal factions, carving their own paths in the wilderness to secure their own interests, challenging the status quo. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Beast:</strong> An enigmatic force threatening the very fabric of the Forgotten Lands.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/61594a58e5cd3c2bb8b6578a1639b7b4.poster.avif?t=1754894026\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/61594a58e5cd3c2bb8b6578a1639b7b4.webm?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059570/extras/61594a58e5cd3c2bb8b6578a1639b7b4.mp4?t=1754894026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Development Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forgotlings is the culmination of a five-year development journey by indie studio Throughline Games, building upon the foundation laid by their previous award-winning title, Forgotton Anne. The game was brought to life with the support of a passionate community through a successful Kickstarter campaign, reflecting a shared love for the team\u2019s vision of storytelling and artistry.</p>",
